      "source": "Trivial implementation of <a href=\"PreparedStatementCreator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql\"><code>PreparedStatementCreator</code></a>. This prepared statement creator simply prepares a\nstatement from the CQL string. Exposes the given CQL statement through <a href=\"CqlProvider.html#getCql()\"><code>CqlProvider.getCql()</code></a>,",
